# Jeong Jeong, the Deserter (2/3, {2}{R}): "Exhaust -- {3}: Put a +1/+1 counter on Jeong Jeong. When you next cast a Lesson spell this
# turn, copy it and you may choose new targets for the copy. (Activate each exhaust ability only once.)" Three Mox Rubies pay the
# ability exactly (he is a 3/4 once it resolves) and the fourth pays Firebending Lesson {R}, aimed at Bot2's Ornithopter. The
# copy (CR 707.10) is aimed at Bot2's Memnite: both 2-damage spells kill their targets. The exhaust ability cannot be activated
# again on turn 5 although four mana are there (CR 702.177a).

